MiControlApp is a macOS menu-bar adapter for Xiaomi Bluetooth Remote 2 Pro
(RC003), informed by the GPL-3.0 project:
https://github.com/xxb26553663-star/remote-bridge-hub

Reference revision:
8a93f321ac71a602300c6cd77f7256fa4b63068e

This repository ships the macOS RC003 adapter only. Changes include a native
SwiftUI menu bar host, CoreBluetooth state machine, system speech recognition,
IOHID permission gating, macOS key injection, packaging, and macOS-focused
tests. The adapted work is distributed under GPL-3.0-only.
